# Redux & Data Fetching

**ALL data fetching in Redux slices via `createAsyncThunk` + axios. NEVER in components.**

- Hooks: `useAppDispatch` / `useAppSelector` from `app/store/hooks.ts`
- Axios only from slices — never raw `fetch` for app APIs
- Learner, staff tokens stay in separate slices and localStorage keys. Company buyers use the staff token with `role=company`.
- Surface errors with `formatAxiosError` from `app/lib/api.ts` in `rejectWithValue`
